# STACKIT Git: **${instance_name}**

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| **Forgejo** | [${instance_url}](${instance_url}) |
| **STACKIT Portal** | [Open in STACKIT Portal](${portal_url}) |
%{ if forgejo_organization != null ~}
| **Organization** | [`${forgejo_organization}`](${organization_url}) |
%{ endif ~}
| **Technical User** | `${local_user_username}` |
| **Shared Runner** | ${length(shared_runner_labels) > 0 ? "`${join("`, `", shared_runner_labels)}`" : "none"} |
%{ if vault_secret_path != null ~}
| **API Token** | key `forgejo-api-token` of the Vault secret `${vault_secret_path}` on mount `${vault_mount}` |
%{ endif ~}
%{ if length(members) > 0 ~}

## Organization members

| Member | Role | Forgejo user |
|--------|------|--------------|
%{ for member in members ~}
| `${member.email}` | `${member.role}` | ${member.username != "" ? "✅ `${member.username}`" : "⚠️ not signed in yet"} |
%{ endfor ~}
%{ if length([for member in members : member if member.username == ""]) > 0 ~}

A member joins their team once they have signed in to [${instance_url}](${instance_url}) with their
STACKIT account. After they have signed in, re-run this building block.
%{ endif ~}
%{ endif ~}
